{
  "title": "Adult Education Classes",
  "type": "gap_fill_exercise",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Good afternoon. Estelle speaking... What can I do for you?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I was told that the school holds...umm, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q1" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, it does. We run seven a week: " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q2" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " and one on Wednesdays." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Are they all " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q3" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "No, because of the number of people who work shifts these days " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q4" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " as well." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, I don't work and I really want to get out and meet people so " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q5" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "What is it you're " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q6" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, anything, really." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Okay...on Tuesdays we have a Writing Workshop for those people " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q7" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " write but are hesitant about putting pen to paper." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Hmm..." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "It's an evening class and runs from six to seven thirty but " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q8" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes. The tutor " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q9" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " restrict participants to a maximum of ten per session...so, I'll have to check and let you know " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q10" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Thank you." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Also on Tuesdays there is a Book Club designed for older adults looking to be inspired, to learn, and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q11" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Are there any restrictions on that?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Not really but " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q12" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " the prescribed book each week." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Mmm, you have to read set books, do you?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q13" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " by finishing one a week." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I understand. What else do you have?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "There's a History Group on Tuesdays as well...run by " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q14" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " who provides a fascinating glimpse for you into " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q15" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " around this area a hundred years ago." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Hmm.. .I don't think so." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, what about Scrabble Club on Wednesday-it's extremely popular, you know." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q16" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " What time?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Two to three thirty in the afternoon." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes. " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q17" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, if you like scrabble you might like to join the Chess Night...on Thursday evenings-" },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q18" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " though." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Unfortunately " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q19" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Would you be interested in Cake Decorating?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q20" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Have you thought about decorated cakes though? You know they make a wonderful focal point of any " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q21" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Maybe not." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Look, I don't know if " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q22" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " but next month there's going to be an Adult Learners' Week and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q23" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " learn something new and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q24" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ". All the events are free but " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q25" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "What are the events?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q26" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " and if you decide there's something in it for you, I can send you " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q27" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Great! When is it?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "The first week " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q28" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ", from the first to the eighth." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, are they all daytime events?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes, but " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q29" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " and some are whole-day sessions." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Can you just quickly tell me about the half-day ones, please?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Okay. The Techno Expo will help you work with " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q30" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " and you can learn more about online privacy and security and online entertainment. That's Monday the first." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "In the morning?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Actually " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q31" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ", from one to 4.30." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "What else is there in the afternoon?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Well, on Wednesday, there's Work/Life Balance-understanding how to " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q32" },
        { "type": "text", "value": ", the importance of balance and harmony in your life and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q33" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "That's another one I'd like to go to-are there any more?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "No, no more half days in the afternoon. Wait a minute... there is a poetry event." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "What does that entail?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Writing some inspirational poems and " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q34" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "No, thank you-I'm not going to read my poems to other people!" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "I know what you mean." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "One " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q35" },
        { "type": "text", "value": " can you tell me " },
        { "type": "blank", "id": "audio37_q36" },
        { "type": "text", "value": "?" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "speaker": "Estelle",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Yes-all the workshops are at the Central Library." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "speaker": "Woman",
      "text": [
        { "type": "text", "value": "Oh, good. That's handy." }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
